// `deploy.failed`: a production or preview build fails. `deploy.live`: a production deploy goes live (off
// until turned on). `domain.attention`: a domain's DNS stops pointing at Orbits, its certificate can't be
// issued, or one within 14 days of expiring hasn't renewed; email goes to everyone who can deploy. A domain
// still not set up an hour after adding it also gets its own DNS email, to whoever added it (the same switch
// turns it off). `member.joined`: someone joins (not told to themselves). `weekly`: Mondays at 9:00 Lagos,
